&lt;p&gt;As developers, we often build projects because we scratch our own itch.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;For me, that itch wasn't another to-do app or weather dashboard—it was personal finance.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I realized that while there are countless calculators online, very few combine wealth tracking, investment planning, and financial forecasting into one simple platform.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;So I decided to build &lt;strong&gt;NetWorthCurve&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;👉 &lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://networthcurve.com" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;https://networthcurve.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


Why I Built It
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I've always been fascinated by one simple question:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;"Am I actually becoming wealthier, or does it just feel that way?"&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Income alone doesn't answer that.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Expenses don't answer that.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Even investments don't tell the complete story.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Your &lt;strong&gt;net worth&lt;/strong&gt; does.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;That idea became the foundation of NetWorthCurve.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


My Background
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I'm an Electronics &amp;amp; Communication Engineering graduate.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;My career has been focused on cybersecurity, where I work as a SOC Analyst.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Working in cybersecurity taught me the importance of building reliable and trustworthy software.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Building NetWorthCurve allowed me to combine that mindset into something people could genuinely use.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;


What NetWorthCurve Can Do
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Today, the platform includes several free financial tools:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;📊 Net Worth Calculator&lt;br&gt;
📄 Personal Balance Sheet Generator&lt;br&gt;
📈 Compound Interest Calculator&lt;br&gt;
🔮 10-Year Compound Interest Forecast&lt;br&gt;
💰 Simple Interest Calculator&lt;br&gt;
💼 Investment Calculator&lt;br&gt;
🏦 Loan Calculator&lt;br&gt;
🌍 Support for 180+ global currencies&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Instead of jumping between multiple websites, I wanted to bring essential financial planning tools together in one place. Whether you're tracking your current net worth, generating a personal balance sheet, estimating loan costs, or forecasting how your investments could grow over the next decade through compound interest, NetWorthCurve is designed to make financial planning simple, accessible, and free.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Challenges While Building&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Like most side projects, the coding wasn't the hardest part.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The real challenges were:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Designing a clean and intuitive interface&lt;br&gt;
Making calculations accurate and reliable&lt;br&gt;
Supporting users from different countries&lt;br&gt;
Optimizing performance across devices&lt;br&gt;
Learning SEO&lt;br&gt;
Growing traffic without a marketing budget&lt;br&gt;
Continuously improving based on user feedback&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Building the product is only the first step.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Getting people to discover it is an entirely different challenge.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Lessons I've Learned&lt;br&gt;
This project has taught me that software isn't just about writing code.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It's about solving real problems.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It's about listening to users.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It's about improving one small detail every single day.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;And perhaps most importantly, it's about staying consistent even when growth is slow.&lt;/p&gt;

